# NIC-Strelka — Strelka's addition to MCUboot: the VBUS gate (FIRMWARE.md, USB)
config STRELKA_VBUS_GATE
	bool "Wait for a serial-recovery command only with VBUS present"
	help
	  With VBUS present at start the recovery waits its seconds on the USB serial port;
	  without it the image boots at once. VBUS is read from the nRF54LM20A's USB regulator.
	  MCUboot asks through the patch in firmware/patches/, which the build needs applied.
